      "title": "One indicator, taken apart",
      "description": "It estimates how many children under 5 live in areas that could be flooded with more than 30 cm of water during a flood with a 2% chance of happening in any given year. Exposure is one of three parts of risk, next to vulnerability and lack of coping capacity.",
